eceived_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\nTested on these two devices, first with `v4.5.1-stable`:\n- Pixel 4a, Qualcomm - Adreno (TM) 618\n- Samsung Tab S 7, Qualcomm - Adreno (TM) 650\n\nReproducible on both devices (black screen), Pixel 4a also crashed after 2 to 3 seconds.\n\n---------------\n\n**This PR:**\n- On my `Samsung Tab S7` I see the \"CameraFeed\", but as soon as I press \"Reload\" or select a different camera (Back / Front), it stops working and the screen remains black.\n\n- On my `Pixel 4a`, I see the \"CameraFeed\" for 2 to 3 seconds, then the app keeps crashing. Should I debug this with Android Studio?\n","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110720#pullrequestreview-3611613299","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110720","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110720#pullrequestreview-3611613299"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110720"}},"submitted_at":"2025-12-24T21:58:08Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3628711299,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7YSb2D","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?u=74caa4e396a8e2995ac648a80f7488601d679e63&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.g